[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5785763562","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122965#issuecomment-5785763562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122965","id":5785763562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWNu-6g","user":{"login":"jack-klein-5","id":56490766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NDkwNzY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56490766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5","html_url":"https://github.com/jack-klein-5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jack-klein-5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T23:06:38Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T23:06:38Z","body":"I was able to reproduce the issue using the MRP. It looks like the VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D component overrides onscreen to false whenever an item enters or leaves the scene tree. RenderingServer doesn't seem to care if it's in the tree or not, so removing this check means that the node could be removed from the tree and still be considered visible with a hanging reference. I made a PR #123737 that would free and reallocate the visibility notifier so the RenderingServer sees it as a new item and refreshes its visibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5785763562/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]